#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:2
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "无障碍功能"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:5
msgid "Review terminal images"
msgstr "查看终端图像"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:7
msgid ""
"Choose **View → Review Images** or press ``kitty_mod+alt+i`` to read the images in the active "
"pane's viewport. The review uses a selectable, read-only text view on macOS or with the Linux GTK"
" backend. When the native backend is unavailable, Silkie uses the configured scrollback pager. "
"Close the review to return keyboard focus to the pane."
msgstr ""
"选择 **View → Review Images**，或按 ``kitty_mod+alt+i``，即可阅读当前窗格视口内的图像说明。在 macOS 或使用 Linux GTK "
"后端时，查看器会打开可选择文本的只读视图。原生后端不可用时，Silkie 会使用已配置的回滚分页器。关闭查看器后，键盘焦点返回终端窗格。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:13
msgid ""
"The review lists images from top to bottom and left to right. It includes essential, informative,"
" and unclassified images. Each entry identifies its purpose and location and includes the name, "
"description, and details the program supplied. To include decorative images, choose **Review All "
"Images**. Scroll the pane first to review images further back in its output."
msgstr ""
"查看器按从上到下、从左到右的顺序列出图像，包括核心、补充说明和未分类的图像。每项会标明用途和位置，并显示程序提供的名称、说明和详情。要查看装饰性图像，选择 **Review All "
"Images**。要查看此前输出中的图像，请先滚动终端窗格。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:19
msgid "Both actions can be bound in ``silkie.conf``::"
msgstr "可以在 ``silkie.conf`` 中为这两个操作绑定快捷键::"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:25
msgid "Describe image placements"
msgstr "描述图像放置"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:27
msgid ""
"Any program using the `kitty graphics protocol <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-"
"protocol/>`_ can annotate a placement. This works with raster graphics and :doc:`vector-"
"protocol`, including SVG. Give the image and its placement nonzero ``i`` and ``p`` IDs and send "
"the annotation after placing the image."
msgstr ""
"任何使用 `kitty 图形协议 <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol/>`_ "
"的程序都可以为图像放置添加注释。此功能适用于光栅图像和 :doc:`vector-protocol`，包括 SVG。请分别为图像和放置指定非零的 ``i`` 和 "
"``p``，并在完成放置后发出注释。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:33
msgid ""
"Discover support by sending the :doc:`capabilities-protocol` query and looking for ``a11y.1`` in "
"``ext``. The selector uses :doc:`extension-framing`."
msgstr ""
"发送 :doc:`capabilities-protocol` 查询，并检查 ``ext`` 中是否包含 ``a11y.1``，即可探测支持情况。此选择器使用 :doc:`extension-"
"framing`。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:40
msgid ""
"``set-image`` replaces the annotation as a unit. ``clear-image`` takes the same placement IDs and"
" removes the annotation. Omitting a descriptive field in ``set-image`` clears its previous value."
msgstr "``set-image`` 会整体替换注释。``clear-image`` 接受同一组放置 ID 并移除注释。``set-image`` 中省略的说明字段会清除相应旧值。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:48
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:49
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:51
msgid "Image ID, required. An unsigned 32-bit integer greater than zero."
msgstr "图像 ID，必填。大于零的 32 位无符号整数。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:53
msgid "Placement ID, required. An unsigned 32-bit integer greater than zero."
msgstr "放置 ID，必填。大于零的 32 位无符号整数。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:55
msgid ""
"``essential`` for an image that carries the subject or result, ``informative`` for supporting "
"material, or ``decorative`` for visual ornament. Omit the field to leave the purpose "
"unclassified."
msgstr "``essential`` 表示承载主题或结果的核心图像，``informative`` 表示提供补充说明的图像，``decorative`` 表示装饰性图像。省略此字段时，用途为未分类。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:59
msgid "Optional short, single-line name."
msgstr "可选的简短单行名称。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:61
msgid "Optional summary of what the image communicates."
msgstr "可选，概述图像传达的信息。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:63
msgid ""
"Optional longer plain-text explanation, data table, or reference URL. The review presents URLs as"
" text that the user can copy."
msgstr "可选，可提供较长的纯文本解释、数据表或参考网址。查看器以可复制的文本显示网址。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:66
msgid "Optional reply correlation ID from zero to 2147483647."
msgstr "可选，用于关联回复的 ID，范围为 0 到 2147483647。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:68
msgid ""
"Percent-encode the UTF-8 bytes of all three text fields, especially colons, percent signs, and "
"non-ASCII bytes. Percent escapes take two hexadecimal digits. Invalid escapes, invalid UTF-8, and"
" control characters reject the entire update. A description or details may include tabs and line "
"breaks encoded as ``%09`` and ``%0A``."
msgstr ""
"对三个文本字段的 UTF-8 字节进行百分号编码，尤其是冒号、百分号和非 ASCII 字节。转义符由百分号和两位十六进制数字组成。无效转义、无效 UTF-8 "
"或控制字符会导致整条更新被拒绝。说明和详情可分别用 ``%09`` 和 ``%0A`` 表示制表符和换行。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:74
msgid ""
"When the request includes ``id``, a successful update replies with ``OK``. A missing image or "
"placement replies with ``ENOENT``. An allocation failure can reply with ``ENOMEM``. Malformed "
"requests receive no reply."
msgstr "请求包含 ``id`` 时，更新成功会回复 ``OK``。图像或放置不存在时回复 ``ENOENT``。内存分配失败时可能回复 ``ENOMEM``。格式有误的请求不会收到回复。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:83
msgid ""
"An annotation belongs to the active screen and follows its placement into scrollback. Moving an "
"existing placement keeps the annotation. Deleting a placement or replacing the image data removes"
" it along with the placement. Virtual placements describe the visible runs of their Unicode "
"placeholders. The review shows one entry per visible virtual placement."
msgstr ""
"注释属于当前屏幕，并随对应的放置进入回滚缓冲区。移动已有的放置时，注释随之保留。删除放置或替换图像数据时，相应放置及其注释也会移除。虚拟放置的注释用于描述其 Unicode "
"占位符的可见部分。查看器为每个可见的虚拟放置列出一项。"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:90
msgid "SVG example"
msgstr "SVG 示例"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:92
msgid ""
"This Python program places a small SVG plot and describes its result. Its standard output should "
"go to a Silkie terminal with SVG and image annotation support::"
msgstr "此 Python 程序会放置一张小型 SVG 图表，并描述图表结果。请将标准输出发送到支持 SVG 和图像注释的 Silkie 终端::"

#: docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:110
msgid ""
"The application supplies the descriptions in the review. A future on-demand interpretation action"
" could use the placement ID to identify the image the user selects."
msgstr "查看器中的说明由应用程序提供。将来，按需解读功能可以用放置 ID 识别用户选中的图像。"

#: ../../../Users/adam/dev/silkie/docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:5
msgid "Magnify a pane"
msgstr "放大终端窗格"

#: ../../../Users/adam/dev/silkie/docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:7
msgid "Use **View → Magnify Pane**, or press ``Ctrl+Alt+=`` to zoom in, ``Ctrl+Alt+−`` to zoom out, and ``Ctrl+Alt+0`` to return to actual size. ``Ctrl+Alt+Arrow`` pans a magnified pane and ``Ctrl+Alt+C`` centers it on the text cursor. On a touchscreen that delivers direct touch events, spread two fingers to zoom and move both fingers together to pan. When a pane is already magnified, a trackpad pinch zooms around the pointer."
msgstr "选择 **View → Magnify Pane**，或按 ``Ctrl+Alt+=`` 放大，按 ``Ctrl+Alt+−`` 缩小，按 ``Ctrl+Alt+0`` 恢复原始大小。用 ``Ctrl+Alt+方向键`` 平移已放大的窗格，用 ``Ctrl+Alt+C`` 将文字光标移到视图中央。支持直接触摸事件的触屏可用双指张开或捏合来缩放，双指同向移动可平移。窗格已放大时，触控板上的捏合手势以指针为中心缩放。"

#: ../../../Users/adam/dev/silkie/docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:14
msgid "Magnification preserves the program's rows, columns, and text layout. Silkie rerasterizes glyphs and vector graphics at the requested resolution, subject to renderer and hardware limits."
msgstr "放大保留程序的行数、列数和文本布局。Silkie 按所选分辨率重新栅格化字形和矢量图形，实际分辨率受渲染器和硬件约束。"

#: ../../../Users/adam/dev/silkie/docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:18
msgid "By default, once a raster image becomes visible during zoom, Silkie reports pixel dimensions at the next whole-number scale, capped at three times the base size. It reports 2× for zoom above 1× through 2×, and 3× above 2×. At actual size it reports the base resolution. Silkie updates the PTY pixel dimensions when the reported scale changes, which delivers a ``SIGWINCH`` on systems that signal pixel-size changes, and sends an in-band resize report to applications that enabled one. A program can query the reported cell size with ``CSI 16 t`` and send an image at that pixel density while keeping the same placement in cells. Silkie scales the available image locally to the selected zoom level."
msgstr "默认情况下，缩放时一旦显示光栅图像，Silkie 就按向上取整的倍数报告像素尺寸，最高为原始尺寸的三倍。缩放倍率大于 1× 且不超过 2× 时报告 2×，大于 2× 时报告 3×。恢复原始大小时报告基础分辨率。报告的倍率发生变化时，Silkie 会更新 PTY 像素尺寸。在支持像素尺寸变更信号的系统上，这会触发 ``SIGWINCH``；启用了带内尺寸报告的应用也会收到报告。程序可用 ``CSI 16 t`` 查询报告的单元格尺寸，再按相应像素密度发送图像，同时保持图像占用的单元格数量。Silkie 会在本地将现有图像缩放到所选倍率。"

#: ../../../Users/adam/dev/silkie/docs/silkie/accessibility.rst:29
msgid "To save bandwidth, keep the reported pixel dimensions at their base values by setting :opt:`magnify_raster_resolution` in ``silkie.conf``::"
msgstr "如需节省带宽，可在 ``silkie.conf`` 中设置 :opt:`magnify_raster_resolution`，使报告的像素尺寸保持为原始值::"

